WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.520
Across Europe, there are lots of strange
tourist attractions that started out

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.000
as useful public transport infrastructure.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.280
Venice has its gondolas.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.520
Lots of cities have cable cars
and funicular railways.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:14.120
And Funchal, here, the capital of Madeira,
has the basket carts.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.360
They are wooden toboggans
on smooth runners

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:21.040
that are powered by people in straw hats
pushing them.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:24.560
And, uh, there aren't any seatbelts.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.720
- From the start,
they used the sledges to bring some wood

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:32.400
from the mountains to the town by the sea.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.960
After that, they adapt for tourists.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:38.120
In total, we are 154 men.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:42.200
We have about 60 baskets running
most of the day.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.920
The toboggan is made of wood, normal wood.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:48.360
And if it sticks to the floor,

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:52.520
we put some grease under the basket
and it slides much better.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:55.800
We have a workshop where
we fix the baskets, and we build new ones.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.680
And we keep rotating the baskets.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:30.370
(IN PORTUGUESE:)
 
 
 

